{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Tobo, a frog who dreams of leaving his village to see the world beyond.</strong> <br>But there\u2019s one problem: no frog can leave unless chosen by the Gods, yet the Gods haven\u2019t come for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a heartfelt journey filled with wonder, mystery, and the charm of seeing the world from a frog\u2019s perspective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc38 <strong>Charming Cast of Frogs</strong> \u2013 meet, befriend, and interact with quirky villagers full of personality. (Total 9 Quirky NPC to meet in the demo)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069310/extras/9786f69f8ecb24ee252af8ee8b2f74ba.poster.avif?t=1759851090\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069310/extras/9786f69f8ecb24ee252af8ee8b2f74ba.webm?t=1759851090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069310/extras/9786f69f8ecb24ee252af8ee8b2f74ba.mp4?t=1759851090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Story-Rich World</strong> \u2013 uncover secrets and immerse yourself in a narrative woven through every corner of the land. (Total of 3 different biome/area to explore in the demo)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069310/extras/036716ab40f79336f852dc978126b31a.poster.avif?t=1759851090\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069310/extras/036716ab40f79336f852dc978126b31a.webm?t=1759851090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069310/extras/036716ab40f79336f852dc978126b31a.mp4?t=1759851090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong> \u2013 solve light, satisfying puzzles that naturally fit the world and its environments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069310/extras/20a4a2af0d1347ced32cd63d0c9a86c6.poster.avif?t=1759851090\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069310/extras/20a4a2af0d1347ced32cd63d0c9a86c6.webm?t=1759851090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069310/extras/20a4a2af0d1347ced32cd63d0c9a86c6.mp4?t=1759851090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A Frog\u2019s Perspective</strong> \u2013 everyday human objects become vast, mysterious landmarks when seen through tiny eyes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069310/extras/d3b9bee47f6deb8827e6006ce089a4a6.poster.avif?t=1759851090\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069310/extras/d3b9bee47f6deb8827e6006ce089a4a6.webm?t=1759851090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069310/extras/d3b9bee47f6deb8827e6006ce089a4a6.mp4?t=1759851090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this demo, you\u2019ll experience the first arc of the story</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"hi